# Rename map for Prince of Persia: The Sands of Time (Series 60 build), read by tools/renamer/ChRenamer.java.
# Lines: class <old> <new> | field <Class.old> <new> | method <Class.old(Params)> <new>, with
# simple class names (the pop2 package is implied). Rename only after inspecting call sites.

# Actor base: position, animation, collision boxes, AI state (Prince extends it).
class a Actor
# The prince: player controls, sword, sand powers.
class d Prince
# The level: tile maps, actor lists, camera, triggers (all static).
class b Level
# Sprite bank: image strips, modules, frames, animations.
class c Sprite
# The canvas: main loop, states, menus, rendering, input, sound, save.
class e Game
